- existing `scripts/test-process-launch-hidden-window.mjs` explicitly requires `-WindowStyle Hidden` and currently fails at that assertion.

Acceptance:
- add the missing explicit hidden PowerShell window argument in the canonical launcher only;
- retain `windowsHide: true` and existing process/output semantics;
- hidden-window regression test passes;
- off-path validation shows CLI descendants can run without a visible console window;
- production serving path is changed only after the existing production-change gate and explicit user authorization for that cutover.
